        "original_id": "8f60a7b1-718a-575f-917c-213fc933480d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Denzel Washington, David Hewlett, Herman Boone\n- Roles: actor, director, producer, writer, voice actor, football coach\n- Organizations: T. C. Williams High School\n- Products: Stargate SG-1, Stargate Atlantis, Stargate Universe, Remember the Titans\n\nFacts:\n- Denzel Hayes Washington Jr. was born on December 28, 1954, and he is an American actor, director, and producer.\n- Herman Ike Boone was born on October 28, 1935, and he is a former American high school football coach.\n- David Ian Hewlett was born on 18 April 1968, and he is an English-born Canadian actor, writer, director, and voice actor.\n- In 1971, Herman Boone coached the T. C. Williams High School football team to a 13-0 season, a state championship, and a national championship runner-up finish.\n- In 2000, the film Remember the Titans was based on Herman Boone and the 1971 T. C. Williams High School football team, and Denzel Washington portrayed Boone in the film.\n- David Hewlett is best known for playing Dr. Rodney McKay on the Canadian-American science fiction television shows Stargate SG-1, Stargate Atlantis, and Stargate Universe.",
